#. told where a script stops itself with exit 3 and its own yaml has no
#. words for it
#: module.yaml
msgid ""
"No internet connection\n"
"\n"
"Join a network with Configure Wi-Fi in Setup, or plug in a cable, and try again. A repair needs none."
msgstr ""

#. told where a script stops itself with exit 4 and its own yaml has no
#. words for it
#: module.yaml
msgid ""
"The release page does not answer\n"
"\n"
"The internet works, but GitHub, where Arch OS keeps its releases, does not answer. Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr ""

#. the header's status, while its check says yes
